{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Bunny Hope</strong>, you\u2019re a brave bunny fighting nightmares to help children sleep peacefully. Use powerful cards and clever strategy in this cozy, dreamlike adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/6e99aa765b27865022ab568aea917738.poster.webp?t=1757778061\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/6e99aa765b27865022ab568aea917738.webp?t=1757778061\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=276 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunny Hope</strong> is a turn-based card battler where you wield dreams, stories and even light as weapons. Build your deck, defeat  nightmares, and guide children toward peaceful slumber. Blending whimsical charm with strategic depth, this  adventure is perfect for players who love tactical games with heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo You will be able to play the first <strong>6 dream</strong> from the game - and You can defeat <strong>5 nightmares</strong>. Additionally You can use only one of the bunnies and unlock a skin for him for the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize your dream-powered card deck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/31b51f60d1ce349dfd32cbdbb57c0e42.poster.webp?t=1757778061\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/31b51f60d1ce349dfd32cbdbb57c0e42.webp?t=1757778061\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=293 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-painted dream worlds, from cozy nurseries to eerie nightmare realms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/72881e37491838b62fc6e8c4dd45bf5b.poster.webp?t=1757778061\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/72881e37491838b62fc6e8c4dd45bf5b.webp?t=1757778061\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=293 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack with lullabies, paintbrushes, and musical blasts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/31b51f60d1ce349dfd32cbdbb57c0e42.poster.webp?t=1757778061\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/31b51f60d1ce349dfd32cbdbb57c0e42.webp?t=1757778061\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=293 /></picture></span>Sweet dreams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/c7adc620dbd45642763a58172d3d6eea.poster.webp?t=1757778061\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/extras/c7adc620dbd45642763a58172d3d6eea.webp?t=1757778061\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=276 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840760?t=1757778061","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/a4eff128d4792ce7a0543955b8047677cca8ad09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757778061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840760/3f3c39fb86debf390959af46ddb9b8d234a5a40b/capsule_2